(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF COMMERCE AND INDUSTRY / MINISTRY OF FINANCE) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: SECTION 80-IAC TAX EXEMPTION FOR STARTUPS \(80-IAC\) / DPIIT / INTER-MINISTERIAL BOARD \(IMB\) / CENTRAL BOARD OF DIRECT TAXES \(CBDT\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(100% income tax deduction on profits and gains for 3 consecutive financial) Tj
T*
(years out of the first 10 years since incorporation for eligible innovative) Tj
T*
(startups.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Incorporated as a Private Limited Company or LLP between April 1, 2016) Tj
T*
(   and March 31, 2025 \(or as extended in Finance Act\).) Tj
T*
(2. Total turnover should not exceed Rs. 100 Crore in any of the previous) Tj
T*
(   financial years.) Tj
T*
(3. Entity must be certified by the Inter-Ministerial Board \(IMB\) of) Tj
T*
(   Certification as an innovative business working towards innovation,) Tj
T*
(   development or improvement of products or processes.) Tj
T*
(4. Company should not be formed by splitting up or reconstruction of an) Tj
T*
(   existing business.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. 100% tax holiday on corporate income profits for any 3 consecutive) Tj
T*
(   assessment years chosen by the startup within its first 10 years.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. DPIIT Certificate of Recognition) Tj
T*
(2. Memorandum of Association \(MoA\) and Articles of Association \(AoA\)) Tj
T*
(3. Audited Balance Sheets, P&L statements, and ITR for the last 3 financial) Tj
T*
(   years \(or since incorporation\)) Tj
T*
(4. Pitch deck and product video demonstrating innovation, IP, and high) Tj
T*
(   commercial potential) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online application via Startup India Portal to Inter-Ministerial Board \(IMB\)) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.startupindia.gov.in/content/sih/en/tax-exemptions.html) Tj
T*
